<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-BT Australia ups Wiluna stake.</title>
<headline>RTRS-BT Australia ups Wiluna stake.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bankers Trust Australia Ltd said on Wednesday it has increased its stake in gold miner Wiluna Mines Ltd to 9.16 percent from 6.86 prcent previously.</p>
<p>Bankers Trust said it now holds 14.78 million shares in Wiluna.</p>
<p>At 11.15 a.m. (0015 GMT), Wiluna shares were one cent down at 89 cents.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
